---
import Badge from "./Badge.astro";
import { skills } from "../lib/constants"
---

<div class="mt-20 flex flex-col items-center">
  <h2
    class="text-light-titles dark:text-dark-titles font-titles text-3xl font-bold text-center"
  >
    About Me
  </h2>
  <div class="w-20 h-2 bg-light-primary dark:bg-dark-primary rounded-xl mt-4">
  </div>
  <p
    class="text-light-texts dark:text-dark-texts font-texts text-lg text-center mt-8 w-96 md:w-[620px]"
  >
    I'm a passionate software engineer with a strong focus on user-centered
    design and full-stack development. In this section, you'll learn more about
    what I do and the technologies I work with to bring ideas to life.
  </p>
</div>

<div class="mt-16 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-16">
  <div>
    <h3
      class="text-light-titles dark:text-dark-titles font-titles text-lg font-semibold text-start"
    >
      Get to know me!
    </h3>
    <p class="text-light-texts dark:text-dark-texts font-texts">
      When working on <b>web projects</b>, I aim to build responsive and accessible
      interfaces that adapt seamlessly across devices. I place a strong emphasis
      on design consistency and front-end architecture that scales. Whether it’s
      a portfolio site, a landing page, a content platform, or an internal dashboard, I enjoy
      refining the <b>user experience</b> to make interactions feel intuitive and
      natural.
      <br /><br />
      In the <b>mobile</b> world, I specialize in <b>iOS development</b>, where I
      focus on delivering smooth, reliable, and visually polished applications.
      I enjoy working with design systems and prototyping features that feel
      native to the platform. My goal is to create apps that not only work well
      but also feel delightful to use—paying close attention to motion,
      gestures, and micro-interactions that enhance the overall experience.
      <br /><br />
      Whether I’m working on a personal project or collaborating with a team, I’m driven by the goal of <b>building experiences that people genuinely enjoy using</b>. I’m always open to new opportunities where I can apply my skills, grow as a developer, and contribute meaningfully to products that make a difference. I believe that <b>great software</b> is built through <b>collaboration</b>, <b>curiosity</b>, and a <b>deep understanding of user needs</b>—and I’m excited to be part of projects that share that vision.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div>
    <h3
      class="text-light-titles dark:text-dark-titles font-titles text-lg font-semibold text-start"
    >
      My Skills
    </h3>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 mt-2">
        {skills.map((item) => (
            <Badge>{item}</Badge>
        ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
